(7737032, 1275113, 103142, '<td valign="top">I assume this is a Rankles? Best one so far. I liked the placement, the horizon not centered. Though I would be curious to see just the left half cropped in and down. The hills and the trees on the left are just about perfect. I love the detail that''s almost a filigree of the trees against the hills. Everything about the left is stunning. The right is nice, too, but sits a bit heavy to me. Though lightening it wouldn''t work, imo, because it is a much heavier scene, and lightening it would look fake. -8-</td>', 'I assume this is a Rankles? Best one so far. I liked the placement, the horizon not centered. Though I would be curious to see just the left half cropped in and down. The hills and the trees on the left are just about perfect. I love the detail that''s almost a filigree of the trees against the hills. Everything about the left is stunning. The right is nice, too, but sits a bit heavy to me. Though lightening it wouldn''t work, imo, because it is a much heavier scene, and lightening it would look fake. -8-', '2023-01-21 17:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
