(7737073, 1275430, 3306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Barroness:</b></div><hr/><i> Amazing, I have shot many birds of prey and I know how quick a sliver of a moment is with them. Sometimes you just catch it right as this one. Congrats <br/>BTW good to see you back. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are absolutely right Debbi! I lay on the ground aimed at this hawk for 20 minutes waiting for a chance at a shot like this. They take off without warning and usually not in the right direction to get a decent shot! Thanks for the comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by Barroness: Amazing, I have shot many birds of prey and I know how quick a sliver of a moment is with them. Sometimes you just catch it right as this one. Congrats BTW good to see you back.   You are absolutely right Debbi! I lay on the ground aimed at this hawk for 20 minutes waiting for a chance at a shot like this. They take off without warning and usually not in the right direction to get a decent shot! Thanks for the comment.', '2023-01-22 10:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
