(7737088, 1275113, 29535, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the kind words everyone! I felt a bit cheeky slotting this in last minute instead of an (arguably inferior) shot I''d entered a couple of weeks before. On the one hand I''m glad the series was generally liked buy everyone and that the day was so successful. On the other I now feel like Marge and the Chanel suit in that episode of the Simpsons and my next task is to mix up my profile as the top 3 shots are now all from the same series. Eek!<br/> <br/>I love a challenge though, here''s to creating something different and maybe surprising in the next couple of weeks :)</td>', 'Thank you for the kind words everyone! I felt a bit cheeky slotting this in last minute instead of an (arguably inferior) shot I''d entered a couple of weeks before. On the one hand I''m glad the series was generally liked buy everyone and that the day was so successful. On the other I now feel like Marge and the Chanel suit in that episode of the Simpsons and my next task is to mix up my profile as the top 3 shots are now all from the same series. Eek! I love a challenge though, here''s to creating something different and maybe surprising in the next couple of weeks :)', '2023-01-22 14:39:29.000000', NULL, 0),
